{"title":"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tarantulas <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccf6d387ce491c0ca100c134021f21f616d75162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> start together at the same time and race straight along a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> foot path, each running at a constant speed the whole distance. \nWhen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> reaches the end, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> still has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet more to run. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> reaches the end, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet more to run. \nHow many more feet does Tarantula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> have to run when Tarantula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> reaches the end?\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Convert the speeds to fractions that relate between the various speeds. Tarantula A runs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> feet in the time Tarantula B runs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet, which implies that Tarantula B's speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7622d6a734ae96f5171044afdaf1470f36e214b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9/10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" />th of Tarantula A's speed. Similarly, Tarantula C's speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/e/b0e6bfd93dee6859c96edb45a14c171e8ca5d8f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8/10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3afa4cd0db0548f54ba32179b7a9644d5d8c181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4/5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />th of Tarantula B's speed. Multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7622d6a734ae96f5171044afdaf1470f36e214b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9/10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3afa4cd0db0548f54ba32179b7a9644d5d8c181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4/5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df520abd4e0f2a9fa0191eb90b0837818beef5f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36/50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" />. Multiplying this by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> feet (the total distance), we find that when Tarantula A finishes, Tarantula C is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> feet in, so Tarantula C has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/1/ef1f1d1f5928b93473a3c9c90cae4bd08a4e3fc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-72=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/f/0df6f7b8b7508033bdb866472ec195ec08cde8f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> feet left when Tarantula A finishes.\n</p><p>-ShootingStars\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II\">2015 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017093202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 173/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 94/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3951/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.049      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    9.049      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13906:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017093202 and revision id 207867. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</d